rights granted by this License and stop distributing or operating the
infringing Monetized Fork, except where applicable law requires otherwise.

Termination does not waive accrued payment obligations or prevent the Licensor
from pursuing remedies available under applicable law. The Licensor may seek
injunctive relief, damages, recovery of unpaid revenue share, reasonable
enforcement costs, or other remedies permitted by applicable law.

